# The wall the shadows climb. It is TEXTURED, and that is the whole reason it
# is here: a baked lightmap receiver has to be untextured (the lightmap needs
# the texture slot), so this surface can take no static shadow at all except a
# baked shadow decal - see docs/shadows.md.
